# Repo Ops & Hygiene
- Don’t rely on `/_scratch` scripts; migrate or delete via PR.
- Enforce dep‑cruiser: PRs fail on cycles/orphans unless justified in an ADR.
- Run `npm run docs:all` on PRs that touch architecture, APIs, or exports.
- Record non‑trivial architectural changes as `/docs/00-foundation/ADR-XXXX.md`.
